data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>卓蘭家庭聚餐</h3> <div class="case-meta" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>卓蘭鎮私宅庭院</span><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>20人</span><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>生日聚會</span></div> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>親友齊聚庭院慶生，現場備妥食材與烤具，家人輕鬆享受烤肉時光。</p> </div> </div> <div class="case-card" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/images/case-villa.jpg" alt="苗栗民宿包棟烤肉服務案例" loading="lazy" width="600" height="450" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="case-body" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h3 data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>苗栗民宿包棟</h3> <div class="case-meta" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>苗栗大湖民宿</span><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>25人</span><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>朋友聚餐</span></div> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>包棟聚會搭配戶外烤肉，團隊依民宿場地安排烤區與菜單。</p> </div> </div> <div class="case-card" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/images/case-company.jpg" alt="台中公司聚餐到府烤肉案例" loading="lazy" width="600" height="450" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="case-body" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h3 data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>台中公司聚餐</h3> <div class="case-meta" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>台中郊區活動場地</span><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>40人</span><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>員工活動</span></div> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>企業部門戶外烤肉活動，依人數準備多組烤架與食材分配。</p> </div> </div> <div class="case-card" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <img src="/images/case-camping.jpg" alt="露營區戶外烤肉服務案例" loading="lazy" width="600" height="450" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="case-body" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h3 data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>露營區烤肉</h3> <div class="case-meta" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>苗栗露營區</span><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>30人</span><span data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>戶外聚會</span></div> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>三組家庭相約露營，到府烤肉服務減少自備器材的麻煩。</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="cases-more" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><a href="/gallery" class="btn btn-outline" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>查看全部案例</a></div> </div> </section> <section class="process" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="container" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h2 class="section-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>預約流程</h2> <div class="process-steps" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="step" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><div class="step-num" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>1</div><h4 data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>來電或 LINE 詢問</h4><p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>撥打 0909-204-600</p></div> <div class="step-connector" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></div> <div class="step" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><div class="step-num" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>2</div><h4 data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>確認人數、地點與菜單</h4><p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>依活動需求討論</p></div> <div class="step-connector" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></div> <div class="step" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><div class="step-num" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>3</div><h4 data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>團隊到府準備</h4><p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>依約定時間到場</p></div> <div class="step-connector" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></div> <div class="step" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><div class="step-num" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>4</div><h4 data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>現場開烤</h4><p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>專人協助享受聚餐</p></div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="faq" id="faq" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="container" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h2 class="section-title" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>常見問題</h2> <div class="faq-list" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="faq-item" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <button class="faq-question" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>服務地區有哪些？<span class="faq-arrow" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><path d="M3 5L7 9L11 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path></svg></span></button> <div class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>以苗栗、卓蘭及周邊地區為主，台中、彰化、南投也可服務，其他地區可來電洽詢。</p></div> </div> <div class="faq-item" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <button class="faq-question" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>最低預約人數是多少？<span class="faq-arrow" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><path d="M3 5L7 9L11 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path></svg></span></button> <div class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>依方案與菜單安排，建議來電或 LINE 詢問。</p></div> </div> <div class="faq-item" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <button class="faq-question" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>需要提前多久預約？<span class="faq-arrow" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><path d="M3 5L7 9L11 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6></path></svg></span></button> <div class="faq-answer" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>建議提前 3–7 天預約，旺季建議更早。</p></div> </div> </div> <div class="faq-more" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6><a href="/faq" class="btn btn-outline" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>查看全部常見問題</a></div> </div> </section> <section class="cta-section" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <div class="container cta-content" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6> <h2 data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>準備好開烤了嗎？</h2> <p data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>立即預約，讓愛烤PRO為您安排</p> <a href="tel:0909204600" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>0909-204-600</a> <a href="https://line.me/R/ti/p/@905pkprt" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>LINE 預約</a> <p class="cta-area" data-astro-cid-j7pv25f6>服務地區：苗栗縣、卓蘭鎮、台中、彰化、南投及周邊</p> </div> </section>   </main> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="container"> <div class="footer-grid"> <div class="footer-brand"> <a href="/" class="footer-logo"> <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 2C14 2 8 8 8 14C8 17.3 10.7 20 14 20C17.3 20 20 17.3 20 14C20 8 14 2 14 2Z" fill="#C75B39"></path><circle cx="14" cy="14" r="3" fill="#FAF6F1"></circle></svg> <span>愛烤<span style="color:#C75B39">PRO</span></span> </a> <p>專業到府代烤服務<br>